tions. Aim sharp, shoot fast, and survive.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 2 \u2013 Survival Hunter Mode\nEndure the chaos and show your Zombie Hunter skills. The longer you last, the higher your score climbs on the board.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 3 \u2013 Pixel Hunter Action\nDive into retro-inspired pixel visuals as a true Zombie Hunter, with immersive VR shooting mechanics for nonstop action.", "short_description": "Be the ultimate Zombie Hunter in VR! Survive pixel zombie waves, rack up kills, and fight for the longest survival time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24619062731066647"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1462397084959795"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1462397084959795"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1756814160, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1462397084959795"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24619087634397490", "versio